h the Phoenix in on the Iron Mountain. Ra is playing and drinking wine at the tavern all day in purgatory. <br>Seeing his old friend Anubis and Frejya, whom he had been in love with for hundreds of years, Ra becomes happy. Frejya is still very beautiful. Anubis and Frejya ask Ra for help. The only salvation of the world is persuading Ra. Ra demands that Pangu's curse be lifted as the only condition for help. This request is sadly denied..",
